<div id="gift-view-memory" phx-hook="ViewMemory" data-restore={to_string(not @view_from_url)} data-key={@editing_id && "starlight-gift-view-#{@editing_id}"} data-view={Jason.encode!(%{tab: (@pack_edit && @pack_edit.parent.active_tab) || @active_tab, section: (@pack_edit && @pack_edit.parent.root_section_id) || @root_section_id})} class="flex flex-col h-full gap-3 overflow-hidden">
  <div id="gift-item-clipboard" phx-hook="ItemClipboard" class="hidden"></div>
  <datalist id="gift-name-options">
    <option :for={gift <- @gifts} value={gift.name} />
  </datalist>

  <.gift_popup popup={@gift_popup} gifts_by_name={@gifts_by_name} gifts_by_id={@gifts_by_id} theme_packs_by_gift_id={@theme_packs_by_gift_id} />
    <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-lg flex flex-col flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="card-body p-3 flex flex-col flex-1 min-h-0 gap-3">
        <%= if @editing_id do %>
          <% issues = GiftPlans.issues(@plan_data, @gifts_by_name) %>

          <div class="flex-1 min-h-0 flex flex-col gap-3 overflow-hidden">

              <% section = selected_section(assigns) %>
              <% pack_views = GiftPlans.pack_views(@plan_data) %>
              <% add_target = target_section(assigns) || section %>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 grid-rows-[minmax(16rem,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] lg:grid-cols-[17rem_1fr] lg:grid-rows-1 gap-3 flex-1 min-h-0">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 min-h-0 pr-1 max-lg:overflow-y-auto">
                  <div :if={issues != []} class="flex flex-col gap-1 text-[11px] text-warning shrink-0 max-h-24 overflow-y-auto">
                    <span :for={issue <- issues}><%= issue %></span>
                  </div>

                  <%= if @active_tab == :loadout or section do %>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0">
                      <label class="input input-bordered input-xs flex flex-1 min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5">
                        <.icon name="lucide-search" class="size-3.5 shrink-0 text-base-content/50" />
                        <input id="gift-search-input" phx-hook="GiftSearchNav" type="text" placeholder="Search gifts (press /)…" value={@gift_filter} phx-keyup="filter_gifts" phx-debounce="150" class="grow min-w-0" />
                      </label>
                      <button type="button" phx-click="clear_gift_filters" title="Clear all filters"
                              class={"btn btn-ghost btn-xs btn-square " <> if(@gift_tier_filter != [] or @gift_affinity_filter != [] or @gift_fixed_filter or @gift_no_pack_filter or @gift_pack_filter != "", do: "", else: "hidden")}><.icon name="lucide-x" class="size-3.5" /></button>
                      <details id="gift-filter-menu" phx-hook="FloatingDropdown" data-keep-open class="dropdown dropdown-end">
                        <summary title="Filter"
                             class={"btn btn-xs btn-square " <> if(@gift_tier_filter != [] or @gift_affinity_filter != [] or @gift_fixed_filter or @gift_no_pack_filter or @gift_pack_filter != "", do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost")}>
                          <.icon name="lucide-funnel" class="size-3.5" />
                        </summary>
                        <div popover="manual" class="dropdown-content z-30 w-56 rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-200 p-2 shadow-lg ring-2 ring-base-content/20 space-y-2">
                          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">Tier</span>
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1">
                              <button :for={tier <- gift_tiers()} type="button" phx-click="set_gift_tier_filter" value={tier}
                                      class={"btn btn-xs " <> if(tier in @gift_tier_filter, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost border-base-300")}>
                                <%= gift_tier_roman(tier) %>
                              </button>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">Affinity</span>
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1">
                              <button :for={affinity <- affinities()} type="button" phx-click="set_gift_affinity_filter" value={affinity} title={affinity}
                                      class={"btn btn-xs btn-square " <> if(affinity in @gift_affinity_filter, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost border-base-300")}>
                                <img src={gift_affinity_icon(affinity)} alt={affinity} class="w-4 h-4" />
                              </button>
                              <button type="button" phx-click="set_gift_affinity_filter" value="none"
                                      class={"btn btn-xs gap-1 " <> if("none" in @gift_affinity_filter, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost border-base-300")}>
                                <.icon name="lucide-circle-off" class="size-3.5" />Keywordless
                              </button>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">Theme pack</span>
                            <details id="gift-pack-filter-menu" phx-hook="FloatingDropdown" data-close-on-click class="dropdown w-full">
                              <summary class="btn btn-xs w-full justify-between font-normal btn-ghost border-base-300">
                                <span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5">
                                  <img :if={@theme_pack_images[@gift_pack_filter]} src={@theme_pack_images[@gift_pack_filter]} class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full object-cover shrink-0" draggable="false" />
                                  <span class="truncate"><%= pack_filter_label(@gift_pack_filter) %></span>
                                </span>
                                <.icon name="lucide-chevron-down" class="size-3.5 shrink-0" />
                              </summary>
                              <div popover="manual" class="dropdown-content z-40 w-52 rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-200 p-1 shadow-lg ring-2 ring-base-content/20">
                                <div class="flex max-h-64 flex-col overflow-y-auto">
                                  <button :for={{value, label} <- [{"", "Any"}, {pack_only_filter(), "Theme pack only"}] ++ Enum.map(theme_pack_names(@theme_packs_by_gift_id), &{&1, &1})}
                                          type="button" phx-click="set_gift_pack_filter" value={value}
                                          class={"btn btn-xs w-full justify-start font-normal " <> if(@gift_pack_filter == value, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost")}>
                                    <img :if={@theme_pack_images[value]} src={@theme_pack_images[value]} class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full object-cover shrink-0" draggable="false" />
                                    <span class="truncate"><%= label %></span>
                                  </button>
                                </div>
                              </div>
                            </details>
                          </div>
                          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">Other</span>
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1">
                              <button type="button" phx-click="toggle_gift_fixed_filter"
                                      class={"btn btn-xs " <> if(@gift_fixed_filter, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost border-base-300")}>
                                Fixed fusions
                              </button>
                              <button type="button" phx-click="toggle_gift_no_pack_filter"
                                      class={"btn btn-xs " <> if(@gift_no_pack_filter, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost border-base-300")}>
                                Theme pack agnostic
                              </button>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </details>
                      <details id="gift-sort-menu" phx-hook="FloatingDropdown" data-keep-open class="dropdown dropdown-end">
                        <summary title={"Sort: #{gift_sort_label(@gift_sort)}"}
                             class={"btn btn-xs btn-square " <> if(@gift_sort != "default", do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost")}>
                          <.icon name="lucide-arrow-down-up" class="size-3.5" />
                        </summary>
                        <div popover="manual" class="dropdown-content z-30 w-36 rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-200 p-1 shadow-lg ring-2 ring-base-content/20">
                          <button :for={sort_by <- gift_sorts()} type="button" phx-click="set_gift_sort" value={sort_by}
                                  class={"btn btn-xs w-full justify-start " <> if(@gift_sort == sort_by, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost")}>
                            <%= gift_sort_label(sort_by) %>
                          </button>
                        </div>
                      </details>
                    </div>

                    <% picks = @plan_data["gift_search"] %>
                    <% added_names = if(@active_tab == :loadout, do: picks, else: add_target["entries"] |> List.wrap() |> Enum.map(&GiftPlans.subject_gift/1) |> Enum.reject(&is_nil/1)) %>
                    <div id="gift-drag-source" phx-hook="GiftDragSource" data-added={Jason.encode!(added_names)} data-add-locked={to_string(@active_tab == :loadout and length(picks) >= GiftPlans.gift_search_max())} class="flex flex-col flex-1 min-h-0 max-lg:min-h-28 overflow-y-auto">
                      <.gift_rows gifts={filtered_gifts(if(@active_tab == :loadout, do: searchable_gifts(@gifts), else: @gifts), @gift_filter, @gift_tier_filter, @gift_affinity_filter, @gift_fixed_filter, @gift_no_pack_filter, @gift_pack_filter, @theme_packs_by_gift_id, @gifts_by_id, @gift_sort)} loadout={@active_tab == :loadout} />
                    </div>
                  <% end %>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 min-h-0 min-w-0">
              <%= if @pack_edit do %>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
                  <button type="button" phx-click="pack_close" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline gap-1" title="Back to the plan">
                    <.icon name="lucide-arrow-left" class="size-4" />Back to plan
                  </button>
                  <.icon name="lucide-package" class="size-5 text-primary shrink-0" />
                  <input id={"pack-name-#{@pack_edit.ref}"} type="text" value={@pack_edit.name} phx-blur="pack_rename" maxlength="60" disabled={@pack_locked}
                         class="input input-bordered input-sm w-56 font-semibold" />
                  <form phx-change="pack_set_affinity" class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <img :if={@pack_edit.affinity != "any"} src={gift_affinity_icon(@pack_edit.affinity)} class="w-4 h-4 object-contain" />
                    <select name="affinity" disabled={@pack_locked} class="select select-bordered select-sm capitalize" title="Affinity this starter pack is meant for">
                      <option :for={affinity <- GiftStarterPacks.affinities()} value={affinity} selected={@pack_edit.affinity == affinity}><%= affinity %></option>
                    </select>
                  </form>
                  <textarea id={"pack-notes-#{@pack_edit.ref}"} rows="1" phx-blur="pack_set_notes" disabled={@pack_locked} placeholder="Notes"
                            class="textarea textarea-bordered textarea-sm flex-1 min-w-48 max-w-xl min-h-0 h-8 resize-y leading-tight"><%= @pack_edit.notes %></textarea>
                  <span :if={@pack_edit.source == :base} class="badge badge-ghost badge-sm" title="Ships with the app">shipped</span>
                  <div class="ml-auto flex items-center gap-1">
                    <PlanHistory.buttons can_undo={@can_undo} can_redo={@can_redo} locked={@pack_locked} />
                    <button :if={@pack_edit.editable} type="button" phx-click="pack_delete" data-confirm={pack_delete_confirm(@pack_edit)}
                            class="btn btn-sm btn-outline btn-error gap-1" title="Delete this starter pack"><.icon name="lucide-trash" class="size-4" />Delete</button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              <% else %>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
                <div class="join">
                  <button id="gift-shop-btn" type="button" phx-click="set_tab" phx-value-tab="shop" class={"btn btn-sm join-item gap-1 " <> if(@active_tab == :shop, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-outline")}><.icon name="lucide-shopping-cart" class="size-4" />Shopping list</button>
                  <button id="gift-loadout-btn" type="button" phx-click="set_tab" phx-value-tab="loadout" class={"btn btn-sm join-item gap-1 " <> if(@active_tab == :loadout, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-outline")}>
                    <.icon name="lucide-backpack" class="size-4" />Loadout
                    <img :if={@plan_data["affinity"] not in [nil, ""]} src={gift_affinity_icon(@plan_data["affinity"])} title={@plan_data["affinity"]} class="sinner-icon w-4 h-4 object-contain shrink-0" />
                    <img :for={name <- GiftPlans.cabinet_order(@plan_data)} :if={@gifts_by_name[name]} src={@gifts_by_name[name].image_path} title={name} class="w-4 h-4 rounded object-cover shrink-0 bg-slate-500/40 ring-1 ring-slate-400/40" />
                  </button>
                </div>
                <div class="ml-auto flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span :if={issues != []} class="badge badge-warning badge-sm" title={Enum.join(issues, "\n")}>
                    <%= length(issues) %> issue(s)
                  </span>
                <% selected_pack = Enum.find(@starter_packs, &(&1.ref == @selected_pack)) %>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                  <details id="starter-pack-menu" phx-hook="FloatingDropdown" data-close-on-click class="dropdown">
                    <summary class="btn btn-sm btn-outline gap-1 max-w-56 justify-between" title="Starter packs: reusable sets of entries and goals to add to a stage">
                      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0">
                        <.icon name="lucide-package" class="size-4 shrink-0" />
                        <span class="truncate"><%= if selected_pack, do: selected_pack.name, else: "Starter pack" %></span>
                      </span>
                      <.icon name="lucide-chevron-down" class="size-3.5 shrink-0" />
                    </summary>
                    <div popover="manual" class="dropdown-content z-30 w-96 max-w-[90vw] max-h-96 overflow-y-auto rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-1 shadow">
                      <ul class="menu w-full p-0">
                        <%= for {affinity, packs} <- GiftStarterPacks.grouped(@starter_packs, @plan_data["affinity"]) do %>
                          <li class="menu-title flex-row items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] capitalize">
                            <img :if={affinity != "any"} src={gift_affinity_icon(affinity)} class="w-3.5 h-3.5 object-contain" /><%= affinity %>
                          </li>
                          <li :for={pack <- packs}>
                            <button type="button" phx-click="pack_select" phx-value-ref={pack.ref} class={"items-start " <> if(pack.ref == @selected_pack, do: "menu-active", else: "")}>
                              <span class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 min-w-0 flex-1 text-left">
                                <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0">
                                  <span class="truncate"><%= pack.name %></span>
                                  <span class="flex items-center gap-0.5 shrink-0">
                                    <img :for={gift <- pack_gifts(pack, @gifts_by_name)} src={gift.image_path} title={gift.name} class="w-5 h-5 rounded object-cover bg-slate-500/40" />
                                  </span>
                                  <span :if={pack.source == :base} class="badge badge-ghost badge-xs ml-auto shrink-0">shipped</span>
                                </span>
                                <span :if={pack.notes != ""} class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60 line-clamp-2 whitespace-pre-line"><%= pack.notes %></span>
                              </span>
                            </button>
                          </li>
                        <% end %>
                        <li :if={@starter_packs == []} class="px-3 py-1 text-xs text-base-content/50 italic">No starter packs yet.</li>
                        <li class="pointer-events-none my-1 h-px bg-base-300 p-0"></li>
                        <li><button type="button" phx-click="pack_new"><.icon name="lucide-plus" class="size-4" />New starter pack</button></li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                  <button type="button" phx-click="pack_edit" disabled={is_nil(selected_pack)} class="btn btn-sm btn-outline btn-square"
                          title={if selected_pack && not selected_pack.editable, do: "View this shipped starter pack", else: "Edit the selected starter pack"}>
                    <.icon name={if selected_pack && not selected_pack.editable, do: "lucide-eye", else: "lucide-pencil"} class="size-4" />
                  </button>
                  <button type="button" phx-click="pack_add" disabled={is_nil(selected_pack) or is_nil(add_target) or Enum.any?(GiftPlans.packs(add_target), &(&1["ref"] == @selected_pack))}
                          class="btn btn-sm btn-outline btn-square" title="Add the selected starter pack to the current stage">
                    <.icon name="lucide-plus" class="size-4" />
                  </button>
                </div>
                  <div class="h-5 w-px bg-base-300"></div>
                    <.template_picker id="gift-template-picker" can_undo={@can_undo} can_redo={@can_redo} templates={@templates} editing={@editing_template} current_count={@tab_counts[:gift_plans]} status={@paste_status} selected={@template_id} plans={@plans} plan_id={@editing_id} editing_plan={@editing_plan} label="gift plan" />
                  <button type="button" phx-click="toggle_help" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline gap-0 overflow-hidden px-0" title="How gift plans work">
                    <span class="flex h-full items-center border-r border-current/30 bg-base-content/10 px-2 text-xs">guide</span>
                    <span class="flex h-full items-center px-2">
                      <.icon name="lucide-info" class="size-4" />
                    </span>
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>

              <% end %>

              <.read_only_banner container="gift-view-memory" allowed={read_only_events()} template_id={if @pack_edit, do: nil, else: @template_id} templates={@templates} label="gift plan"
                                 locked_label={if @pack_locked, do: "Read-only starter pack. This one ships with the app and only authors can change it."} />
                <div id="gift-drop-zone" phx-hook="GiftDropZone"
                     data-drop-event={if @active_tab == :loadout, do: "toggle_search_gift", else: section && "list_add_gift"}
                     class="flex flex-col gap-3 overflow-y-auto flex-1 min-h-0 pr-1 rounded-lg transition-colors">
                  <%= if @active_tab == :loadout do %>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3 flex-wrap">
                <form phx-change="set_affinity" class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                  <details id="gift-affinity-menu" phx-hook="FloatingDropdown" data-close-on-click class="dropdown">
                    <summary class="btn btn-outline capitalize! text-base gap-1.5 justify-between min-w-40 min-h-10 min-[600px]:min-h-[3.625rem]">
                      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <img :if={@plan_data["affinity"] not in [nil, ""]} src={gift_affinity_icon(@plan_data["affinity"])} class="w-4 h-4 object-contain" />
                        <%= if @plan_data["affinity"] in [nil, ""], do: "Select affinity", else: @plan_data["affinity"] %>
                      </span>
                      <.icon name="lucide-chevron-down" class="size-3.5" />
                    </summary>
                    <div popover="manual" class="dropdown-content z-30 w-max rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-1 shadow">
                      <ul class="menu w-40 p-0">
                        <%= for affinity <- affinity_order() do %>
                          <li :if={affinity == "slash"} class="pointer-events-none my-1 h-px bg-base-300 p-0"></li>
                          <li>
                            <label class="cursor-pointer">
                              <input type="radio" name="affinity" value={affinity} checked={@plan_data["affinity"] == affinity} class="hidden" />
                              <img src={gift_affinity_icon(affinity)} class="w-4 h-4 object-contain" /><span class="capitalize"><%= affinity %></span>
                            </label>
                          </li>
                        <% end %>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                </form>
                <div :if={GiftPlans.cabinet_order(@plan_data) != []} id="cabinet-bracket" phx-hook="CabinetBracket" data-count={GiftPlans.cabinet_pick_count(@plan_data)} class="relative pb-8">
                <div id="cabinet-gift-order" phx-hook="SortableList"
                     data-sort-event="reorder_cabinet_gifts" data-sort-scope="cabinet" data-sort-axis="x" class="flex items-center gap-1 min-[600px]:gap-2"
                     title="Starting gift pick order. The cabinet only allows as many picks as your graces give.">
                  <% pick_count = GiftPlans.cabinet_pick_count(@plan_data) %>
                  <div :for={{name, index} <- Enum.with_index(GiftPlans.cabinet_order(@plan_data), 1)} data-sort-id={name}
                       class={"relative flex items-center gap-1 min-[600px]:gap-2 min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-200 p-1 min-[600px]:p-2 min-h-10 min-[600px]:min-h-14 transition-opacity " <> if(index > pick_count, do: "opacity-40", else: "")}>
                    <span :if={index <= pick_count} class={"absolute -bottom-2 h-1.5 border-b-2 border-primary pointer-events-none " <> if(index == 1, do: "left-0 border-l rounded-bl", else: "-left-1 min-[600px]:-left-2") <> " " <> if(index == pick_count, do: "right-0 border-r rounded-br", else: "-right-1 min-[600px]:-right-2")}></span>
                    <span data-sort-handle class="cursor-grab text-base-content/40 select-none">⠿</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-base-content/40"><%= index %></span>
                    <% gift = @gifts_by_name[name] %>
                    <div data-gift-popup={name} class="flex items-center gap-1 min-[600px]:gap-2 min-w-0 cursor-pointer">
                      <img :if={gift} src={gift.image_path} class="w-6 h-6 min-[600px]:w-10 min-[600px]:h-10 rounded object-cover" />
                      <span class="text-[10px] min-[600px]:text-xs font-semibold truncate"><%= name %></span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span id="cabinet-bracket-label" data-bracket-label phx-update="ignore" class="absolute bottom-0 text-center text-xs text-base-content/60 whitespace-nowrap">Starting E.G.O gifts</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="divider my-0"></div>

              <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm ml-auto whitespace-nowrap shrink-0"><%= grace_total_cost(@plan_data) %> Starlight total</span>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 grid-rows-5 min-[600px]:grid-cols-5 min-[600px]:grid-rows-2 gap-2">
                  <%= for {grace, number} <- Enum.with_index(graces(), 1) do %>
                    <% pick = grace_pick(@plan_data, grace.index) %>
                    <% level = if pick, do: pick["enhance"], else: 0 %>
                    <div phx-click="toggle_grace" phx-value-index={grace.index}
                         class={"relative cursor-pointer rounded-lg border p-2 flex flex-col gap-1 min-w-0 " <>
                           if(pick, do: "bg-primary/10 border-primary", else: "border-base-300 hover:bg-base-200")}>
                      <img src={"/images/graces/grace_#{grace.index}.webp"} alt=""
                           class={"absolute top-1.5 right-1.5 h-6 w-6 object-contain " <> if(pick, do: "opacity-100", else: "opacity-40")} />
                      <span class="text-xs font-semibold pr-7"><%= number %>. <%= grace.name %></span>
                      <span class="badge badge-ghost badge-xs self-start max-w-full"><span class="truncate"><%= grace_level_cost(grace, level) %> Starlight</span></span>
                      <p class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60 leading-snug"><%= grace_effect(grace, level) %></p>
                      <div class="join w-full mt-auto pt-1">
                        <button :for={enhance_level <- [1, 2]} type="button" phx-click="set_grace_enhance"
                                phx-value-index={grace.index} phx-value-level={if pick && level == enhance_level, do: 0, else: enhance_level}
                                class={"btn btn-xs join-item flex-1 " <> if(pick && level >= enhance_level, do: "btn-secondary", else: "btn-outline")}>
                          <%= grace_enhance_icon(enhance_level) %>
                        </button>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  <% end %>
                </div>
                <% perfected = GiftPlans.perfected_pick(@plan_data) %>
                <div :if={perfected} class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-lg border border-base-300 p-2">
                  <% options = perfected_options(@plan_data) %>
                  <% priority = GiftPlans.perfected_priority(@plan_data, options) %>
                  <% unprioritized = GiftPlans.perfected_unprioritized(@plan_data, options) %>
                  <span class="text-xs font-medium text-base-content/70">Perfected Possibility gifts. Higher in the list is picked first; drag to reorder, or ban a gift to move it to the unprioritized side.</span>
                  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 items-start">
                    <div id="perfected-priority" phx-hook="SortableList" data-sort-event="reorder_perfected_gifts" data-sort-move-event="move_perfected_gift"
                         data-sort-axis="x" data-sort-scope="priority" data-sort-shared="perfected" data-sort-highlight
                         class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1 min-[600px]:gap-2 min-h-12 flex-1 min-w-48 rounded-lg p-1 transition-colors">
                      <div :for={{name, index} <- Enum.with_index(priority, 1)} data-sort-id={name}
                           class="flex items-center gap-1 min-[600px]:gap-2 min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-200 p-1 min-[600px]:p-2 min-h-10 min-[600px]:min-h-14">
                        <span data-sort-handle class="cursor-grab text-base-content/40 select-none">⠿</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-base-content/40"><%= index %></span>
                        <% gift = @gifts_by_name[name] %>
                        <div data-gift-popup={name} class="flex items-center gap-1 min-[600px]:gap-2 min-w-0 cursor-pointer">
                          <img :if={gift} src={gift.image_path} class="w-6 h-6 min-[600px]:w-10 min-[600px]:h-10 rounded object-cover" />
                          <span class="text-[10px] min-[600px]:text-xs font-semibold truncate"><%= name %></span>
                        </div>
                        <button type="button" phx-click="toggle_perfected_gift" phx-value-gift={name} title="Don't prioritize" class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs btn-square">
                          <.icon name="lucide-ban" class="size-4" />
                        </button>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="perfected-pool" phx-hook="SortableList" data-sort-event="reorder_perfected_gifts" data-sort-move-event="move_perfected_gift"
                         data-sort-axis="x" data-sort-scope="pool" data-sort-shared="perfected" data-sort-highlight
                         class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1 min-[600px]:gap-2 min-h-12 flex-1 min-w-48 rounded-lg border-2 border-dashed border-base-content/20 p-1 transition-colors">
                      <div :for={name <- unprioritized} data-sort-id={name}
                           class="flex items-center gap-1 min-[600px]:gap-2 min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-200 p-1 min-[600px]:p-2 min-h-10 min-[600px]:min-h-14 opacity-60">
                        <span data-sort-handle class="cursor-grab text-base-content/40 select-none">⠿</span>
                        <% gift = @gifts_by_name[name] %>
                        <div data-gift-popup={name} class="flex items-center gap-1 min-[600px]:gap-2 min-w-0 cursor-pointer">
                          <img :if={gift} src={gift.image_path} class="w-6 h-6 min-[600px]:w-10 min-[600px]:h-10 rounded object-cover" />
                          <span class="text-[10px] min-[600px]:text-xs font-semibold truncate"><%= name %></span>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <form :if={priority != []} phx-change="set_perfected_restart">
                    <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer w-fit"
                           title="Checked at the dungeon graph on floor 1, at least 15 seconds into the run, and only until the first event, battle or shop. Forfeits and restarts the run if the gift isn't in your inventory.">
                      <input type="hidden" name="restart" value="false" />
                      <input type="checkbox" name="restart" value="true" checked={perfected["restart_without_target"] == true} class="toggle toggle-sm toggle-primary" />
                      <span class="text-xs">Restart the run if <%= List.first(priority) %> isn't in my inventory</span>
                    </label>
                  </form>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="divider my-0"></div>

              <% picks = @plan_data["gift_search"] %>
              <% max = GiftPlans.gift_search_max() %>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-xs font-medium text-base-content/70">
                    E.G.O Gift Search - Spend starlight to start with any gift up to Tier 3.
                  </span>
                  <span :if={picks != []} class="badge badge-warning badge-sm ml-auto whitespace-nowrap">
                    <%= GiftPlans.gift_search_starlight_cost(length(picks)) %> Starlight
                  </span>
                  <span class={"badge badge-primary badge-sm whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 " <> if(picks == [], do: "ml-auto", else: "")}><%= length(picks) %> / <%= max %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
                  <%= for slot <- 0..(max - 1) do %>
                    <% name = Enum.at(picks, slot) %>
                    <% gift = name && @gifts_by_name[name] %>
                    <div phx-click={!name && JS.focus(to: "#gift-search-input")}
                         class={"rounded-lg border p-2 flex items-center gap-2 min-h-14 " <>
                           cond do
                             name -> "bg-primary/10 border-primary"
                             slot == length(picks) -> "border-2 border-dashed border-primary/70 bg-primary/5 cursor-pointer hover:bg-primary/10 hover:border-primary"
                             true -> "border-2 border-dashed border-base-content/20 cursor-pointer hover:border-primary/60 hover:bg-primary/5"
                           end}>
                      <%= if name do %>
                        <div data-gift-popup={name} class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-1 min-w-0 text-left cursor-pointer">
                          <img :if={gift} src={gift.image_path} class="w-10 h-10 rounded object-cover" />
                          <div class="flex flex-col flex-1 min-w-0">
                            <span class="text-xs font-semibold truncate" title={name}><%= name %></span>
                            <span :if={gift} class="text-[10px] text-base-content/60">
                              T<%= gift.tier %> · <%= GiftPlans.gift_search_tab(gift) %> tab
                            </span>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="badge badge-warning badge-xs whitespace-nowrap"><%= GiftPlans.gift_search_slot_cost(slot) %> Starlight</span>
                        <button phx-click="toggle_search_gift" phx-value-gift={name} class="btn btn-ghost btn-2xs px-1"><.icon name="lucide-x" class="size-3.5" /></button>
                      <% else %>
                        <div class={"w-10 h-10 shrink-0 rounded border border-dashed flex items-center justify-center text-xl leading-none " <>
                               if(slot == length(picks), do: "border-primary/70 text-primary animate-pulse", else: "border-base-content/30 text-base-content/40")}>+</div>
                        <span class={"text-[11px] flex-1 " <> if(slot == length(picks), do: "text-base-content/80", else: "text-base-content/50")}>Drag or Add a gift from the list</span>
                        <span class="badge badge-ghost badge-xs whitespace-nowrap">+<%= GiftPlans.gift_search_slot_cost(slot) %> Starlight</span>
                      <% end %>
                    </div>
                  <% end %>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="divider my-0"></div>

              <% rows = @plan_data["mounting_trials"] %>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-base-content/70">Mounting Trials</span>
                  <button type="button" phx-click="add_mounting_row" disabled={Enum.any?(rows, &(&1["from_floor"] >= 15))}
                          class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs ml-auto">Add Schedule</button>
                </div>
                <form phx-change="update_mounting" class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                  <div :for={{row, index} <- Enum.with_index(rows)} class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-1 py-1">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/70 w-12 shrink-0 px-1">from</span>
                    <span :if={index == 0} class="text-[11px] font-semibold w-12 px-1">F1</span>
                    <select :if={index > 0} name={"rows[#{index}][from_floor]"} class="select select-bordered select-xs w-16">
                      <option :for={floor <- 1..15} value={floor} selected={row["from_floor"] == floor}>F<%= floor %></option>
                    </select>
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/70">pick</span>
                    <select name={"rows[#{index}][mode]"} class="select select-bordered select-xs">
                      <option :for={mode <- GiftPlans.mounting_trials_modes()} value={mode} selected={row["mode"] == mode}><%= GiftPlans.mounting_trials_mode_label(mode) %></option>
                    </select>
                    <button type="button" phx-click="remove_mounting_row" phx-value-index={index} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs px-1 text-error ml-auto"><.icon name="lucide-x" class="size-3.5" /></button>
                  </div>
                </form>
                <span :if={rows == []} class="text-[11px] text-base-content/50 italic">No floors set; every floor uses best gift.</span>
              </div>

              <div class="divider my-0"></div>

              <% encounter_rows = @plan_data["encounter_rewards"] %>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-base-content/70">Encounter Reward</span>
                  <button type="button" phx-click="add_encounter_row" disabled={Enum.any?(encounter_rows, &(&1["from_floor"] >= 15))}
                          class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs ml-auto">Add Schedule</button>
                </div>
                <div :for={{row, index} <- Enum.with_index(encounter_rows)} class="flex flex-col gap-1 rounded border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-1 py-1">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/70 w-12 shrink-0 px-1">from</span>
                    <span :if={index == 0} class="text-[11px] font-semibold w-12 px-1">F1</span>
                    <form :if={index > 0} phx-change="set_encounter_floor">
                      <input type="hidden" name="index" value={index} />
                      <select name="from_floor" class="select select-bordered select-xs w-16">
                        <option :for={floor <- 1..15} value={floor} selected={row["from_floor"] == floor}>F<%= floor %></option>
                      </select>
                    </form>
                    <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/50">first visible, top to bottom</span>
                    <button :if={index > 0} type="button" phx-click="remove_encounter_row" phx-value-index={index} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs px-1 text-error ml-auto"><.icon name="lucide-x" class="size-3.5" /></button>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 pl-1">
                    <div id={"encounter-order-#{index}"} phx-hook="SortableList" data-sort-event="reorder_encounter" data-sort-scope={index} class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                      <div :for={{key, position} <- Enum.with_index(row["order"])} data-sort-id={key} class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded border border-base-300 bg-base-100 px-2 py-0.5">
                        <span data-sort-handle class="cursor-grab text-base-content/40 select-none">⠿</span>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/50 w-4"><%= position + 1 %></span>
                        <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold"><%= GiftPlans.encounter_reward_label(key) %></span>
                        <button type="button" phx-click="encounter_remove" phx-value-index={index} phx-value-key={key} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs px-1 text-error ml-auto"><.icon name="lucide-x" class="size-3.5" /></button>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded border border-dashed border-base-300 px-2 py-0.5">
                      <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/50 w-4"><%= length(row["order"]) + 1 %></span>
                      <span class="text-[11px] italic text-base-content/60">Highest tier available</span>
                    </div>
                    <div :if={GiftPlans.encounter_reward_options() -- row["order"] != []} class="flex items-center gap-1 flex-wrap">
                      <button :for={key <- GiftPlans.encounter_reward_options() -- row["order"]} type="button" phx-click="encounter_add" phx-value-index={index} phx-value-key={key}
                              class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs">+ <%= GiftPlans.encounter_reward_label(key) %></button>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
                  <% else %>
                  <%= if section do %>
                    <.heal_entries :if={is_nil(@pack_edit)} section={section} entry_tabs={@entry_tabs} gifts_by_name={@gifts_by_name} gifts_by_id={@gifts_by_id} plan_data={@plan_data} editing_branch={@editing_condition_case_id} />
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-base-content/30 p-2 shrink-0">
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                      <div class="flex items-stretch gap-2 flex-wrap flex-1 min-w-0 rounded-xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200/60 p-1">
                        <.stage_title id={section["id"]} name={GiftPlans.section_name(section)} renaming_id={@renaming_stage_id}
                                      title="Double-click to rename. Name of the first stage, shown in refresh stages and run progress." />
                        <.goal_chips section={section} views={Map.get(pack_views, section["id"], [])} />
                      </div>
                      <div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1 shrink-0 ml-auto">
                      <div :if={is_nil(@pack_edit)} class="flex items-center gap-1">
                        <details :for={{action, label} <- [{"heal", "+ Greatly heal"}, {"revive", "+ Revive"}]} id={"#{action}-menu-#{section["id"]}"} phx-hook="FloatingDropdown" data-close-on-click class="dropdown dropdown-end">
                          <summary class="btn btn-xs btn-outline"><%= label %></summary>
                          <div popover="manual" class="dropdown-content z-30 w-80 max-w-[90vw] rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-1 shadow-lg"><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-1">
                            <button :if={action == "revive"} type="button" phx-click="list_add_action" phx-value-action="revive" phx-value-sinner="everyone"
                                    class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs col-span-3 justify-start gap-1 px-1"><.icon name="lucide-users" class="size-4" />Everyone</button>
                            <button :for={sinner <- @sinners} type="button" phx-click="list_add_action" phx-value-action={action} phx-value-sinner={sinner}
                                    title={sinner_label(sinner)} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs min-w-0 flex-nowrap justify-start gap-1 px-1">
                              <img src={StarlightBot.SinnerProfiles.icon(sinner)} class="sinner-icon h-4 w-4 shrink-0 object-contain" /><span class="truncate"><%= sinner_label(sinner) %></span>
                            </button>
                          </div>
                          </div>
                        </details>
                        <button type="button" phx-click="list_add_action" phx-value-action="heal_all" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline">+ Heal all</button>
                        <button type="button" phx-click="list_add_action" phx-value-action="team_replace" disabled={Enum.any?(section["entries"], &GiftPlans.team_replace_entry?/1)}
                                title={"Swap sinners' identities in the shop's team replace, up to #{GiftPlans.team_replace_max()} per shop"} class="btn btn-xs btn-outline">+ Team replace</button>
                      </div>
                      <% offers = if @pack_edit, do: [], else: loadout_offers(@plan_data, section) %>
                      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 flex-wrap justify-end">
                        <div :if={offers != []} class="flex items-center gap-1 flex-wrap justify-end" title="Gifts you start with that the shopping list doesn't have. Adds them as optional keeps.">
                          <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">Loadout</span>
                          <button :for={{name, source} <- offers} type="button" phx-click="list_add_loadout_gift" phx-value-gift={name}
                                  title={source} class="btn btn-xs btn-outline gap-1 px-1">
                            <img :if={@gifts_by_name[name]} src={@gifts_by_name[name].image_path} class="w-4 h-4 rounded object-cover bg-slate-500/40" />
                            + <%= name %>
                          </button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-1"
                             title="Any-tier and any-affinity entries never count toward goals and never keep anything. Buy buys matches when nothing wanted is on the shelf; Sell sells matches at the start of each stage. A specific gift entry overrides them.">
                          <details id={"any-tier-menu-#{section["id"]}"} phx-hook="FloatingDropdown" data-close-on-click class="dropdown dropdown-end">
                            <summary class="btn btn-xs btn-outline">+Any tier</summary>
                            <div popover="manual" class="dropdown-content z-30 w-44 rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-1 shadow-lg">
                              <button type="button" phx-click="list_add_affinity_any" phx-value-affinity="none" class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs w-full justify-start">
                                <.icon name="lucide-circle-off" class="size-3.5" />Keywordless
                              </button>
                              <div class="my-1 border-t border-base-300"></div>
                              <%= for affinity <- affinity_order() do %>
                                <div :if={affinity == "slash"} class="my-1 border-t border-base-300"></div>
                                <button type="button" phx-click="list_add_affinity_any" phx-value-affinity={affinity} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs w-full justify-start capitalize">
                                  <img src={gift_affinity_icon(affinity)} class="w-3.5 h-3.5 object-contain" /><%= affinity %>
                                </button>
                              <% end %>
                            </div>
                          </details>
                          <details :for={tier <- GiftPlans.shop_tiers()} id={"tier-#{tier}-menu-#{section["id"]}"} phx-hook="FloatingDropdown" data-close-on-click class="dropdown dropdown-end">
                            <summary class="btn btn-xs btn-outline">+T<%= tier %></summary>
                            <div popover="manual" class="dropdown-content z-30 w-52 rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-1 shadow-lg">
                              <div class="flex gap-0.5">
                                <button type="button" phx-click="list_add_tier" phx-value-tier={tier} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs flex-1 justify-start">Any</button>
                                <button type="button" phx-click="list_add_affinity" phx-value-affinity="none" phx-value-tier={tier} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs flex-1 justify-start">
                                  <.icon name="lucide-circle-off" class="size-3.5" />Keywordless
                                </button>
                              </div>
                              <div class="my-1 border-t border-base-300"></div>
                              <%= for affinity <- affinity_order() do %>
                                <div :if={affinity == "slash"} class="my-1 border-t border-base-300"></div>
                                <button type="button" phx-click="list_add_affinity" phx-value-affinity={affinity} phx-value-tier={tier} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs w-full justify-start capitalize">
                                  <img src={gift_affinity_icon(affinity)} class="w-3.5 h-3.5 object-contain" /><%= affinity %>
                                </button>
                              <% end %>
                            </div>
                          </details>
                        </div>
                        <details :if={is_nil(@pack_edit)} id={"skill-replace-menu-#{section["id"]}"} phx-hook="FloatingDropdown" data-close-on-click class="dropdown dropdown-end">
                          <summary class="btn btn-xs btn-outline">+ Skill replace</summary>
                          <div popover="manual" class="dropdown-content z-30 w-80 max-w-[90vw] rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-1 shadow-lg"><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-1">
                            <button :for={sinner <- @sinners} type="button" phx-click="list_add_action" phx-value-action="skill_replace" phx-value-sinner={sinner}
                                    title={sinner_label(sinner)} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs min-w-0 flex-nowrap justify-start gap-1 px-1">
                              <img src={StarlightBot.SinnerProfiles.icon(sinner)} class="sinner-icon h-4 w-4 shrink-0 object-contain" /><span class="truncate"><%= sinner_label(sinner) %></span>
                            </button>
                          </div>
                          </div>
                        </details>
                      </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <div data-drop-section={section["id"]} class="flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-lg shrink-0 pl-2">
                      <.section_entries section={section} packs_enabled={is_nil(@pack_edit)} views={Map.get(pack_views, section["id"], [])} entry_tabs={@entry_tabs} gifts_by_name={@gifts_by_name} gifts_by_id={@gifts_by_id} plan_data={@plan_data} editing_branch={@editing_condition_case_id} />
                      <div :if={Enum.all?(section["entries"], &GiftPlans.heal_entry?/1) and Map.get(pack_views, section["id"], []) == []} class="text-xs text-base-content/40 italic">No entries yet. Add gifts from the search on the left.</div>
                    </div>
                    </div>

                      <div :for={{stage, number} <- Enum.with_index(GiftPlans.stages(@plan_data, section["id"]), 2)} data-drop-section={stage["id"]} class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-base-content/30 p-2 shrink-0">
                        <div class="flex items-stretch gap-2 flex-wrap rounded-xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200/60 p-1">
                          <.stage_title id={stage["id"]} name={stage["name"]} renaming_id={@renaming_stage_id}
                                        title="Double-click to rename. Worked on once everything above is done. Refreshes are shared with the shop, and everything above stays kept." />
                          <.goal_chips section={stage} views={Map.get(pack_views, stage["id"], [])} />
                          <span class="ml-auto flex items-center">
                            <button type="button" phx-click="list_move_stage" phx-value-id={stage["id"]} phx-value-dir="up" class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs px-1" title={if number == 2, do: "Swap with the first section (heal entries stay there)", else: "Move this stage earlier"}><.icon name="lucide-arrow-up" class="size-3.5" /></button>
                            <button type="button" phx-click="list_move_stage" phx-value-id={stage["id"]} phx-value-dir="down" disabled={number == length(GiftPlans.stages(@plan_data, section["id"])) + 1} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs px-1" title="Move this stage later"><.icon name="lucide-arrow-down" class="size-3.5" /></button>
                          </span>
                          <button type="button" phx-click="list_remove_stage" phx-value-id={stage["id"]} data-confirm={"Remove stage #{number} and its entries?"}
                                  class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs px-1 text-error" title="Remove this stage and its entries"><.icon name="lucide-x" class="size-3.5" /></button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 pl-2">
                          <.section_entries section={stage} packs_enabled={is_nil(@pack_edit)} views={Map.get(pack_views, stage["id"], [])} entry_tabs={@entry_tabs} gifts_by_name={@gifts_by_name} gifts_by_id={@gifts_by_id} plan_data={@plan_data} editing_branch={@editing_condition_case_id} />
                          <div :if={Enum.all?(stage["entries"], &GiftPlans.heal_entry?/1) and Map.get(pack_views, stage["id"], []) == []} class="text-xs text-base-content/40 italic">No entries yet. Drag gifts here from the search on the left.</div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div :if={section["pursue_optional"] == true and is_nil(@pack_edit)} class="flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-base-content/30 p-2 shrink-0">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                          <span class="px-2 text-xs font-semibold">Keep shopping</span>
                          <button type="button" phx-click="list_set_pursue_optional" value="false" class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs px-1 ml-auto text-error" title="Stop keeping shopping after the last stage"><.icon name="lucide-x" class="size-3.5" /></button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="px-2 text-xs text-base-content/60">After the last stage is done, the bot keeps buying and refreshing until a refresh case leaves the shop. It buys optional gifts from every stage, plus anything the last stage's Ignore + Buy entries (any tier, any affinity) match, up to their caps.</div>
                      </div>
                      <div :if={is_nil(@pack_edit)} class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
                        <button type="button" phx-click="list_add_stage" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline"
                                title="Add another set of required entries and goals, worked on after everything above is done">+ Add stage</button>
                        <button :if={section["pursue_optional"] != true} type="button" phx-click="list_set_pursue_optional" value="true" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline"
                                title="After the last stage is done, keep buying optional gifts and the last stage's Ignore + Buy matches, and keep refreshing, instead of finishing the shop">+ Keep shopping</button>
                      </div>

                    <%= if is_nil(@pack_edit) do %>
                    <% refresh_from = active_refresh_from(@refresh_tabs, section) %>
                    <% refresh_scheduled = section["refresh_scheduled"] == true %>
                    <div class="flex flex-col mt-4 rounded-xl bg-base-300 p-2">
                      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pb-1">
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold"><.icon name="lucide-refresh-cw" class="size-4" />Refresh</span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-base-content/60">Applies to every stage</span>
                        <button phx-click="list_add_refresh_case" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline">+ Case</button>
                        <.refresh_costs section={section} from={refresh_from} path={refresh_path(assigns, section, refresh_from)} plan_data={@plan_data} />
                        <button :if={not refresh_scheduled} type="button" phx-click="list_refresh_add_schedule" class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs ml-auto">Add Schedule</button>
                      </div>
                      <.refresh_tabs :if={refresh_scheduled} section={section} from={refresh_from} />
                      <div class={"flex flex-col gap-1 " <> if(refresh_scheduled, do: "p-1 border-2 border-primary rounded-b-lg rounded-tr-lg", else: "")}>
                        <div id={"refresh-cases-#{section["id"]}-#{refresh_from}"} phx-hook="SortableList" data-sort-event="list_reorder_refresh" data-sort-scope={section["id"]}
                             class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                          <div :for={{refresh_case, index} <- Enum.with_index(GiftPlans.refresh_cases(section, refresh_from))} data-sort-id={refresh_case["id"]}
                               class="rounded border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-1 py-1 flex items-start gap-2">
                            <span data-sort-handle class="cursor-grab text-base-content/40 select-none px-1 leading-6">⠿</span>
                            <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/70 w-12 shrink-0 leading-6"><%= if index == 0, do: "if", else: "else if" %></span>
                            <div class="flex-1 min-w-64">
                              <%= if refresh_case["condition"] do %>
                                <%= if @editing_condition_case_id == refresh_case["id"] do %>
                                  <div phx-click-away="close_case_condition" class="flex items-start gap-1">
                                    <button type="button" phx-click="close_case_condition" title="Close the condition editor" class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs h-6 min-h-6 px-1">▾</button>
                                    <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                                      <.condition_node node={refresh_case["condition"]} path="" values={%{"case_id" => refresh_case["id"]}} removable={false}
                                                       leaf={&gift_leaf(Map.merge(&1, %{plan_data: @plan_data, section: section}))} />
                                    </div>
                                  </div>
                                <% else %>
                                  <button type="button" phx-click="open_case_condition" phx-value-case_id={refresh_case["id"]}
                                          class="btn btn-outline btn-xs bg-base-100 h-6 min-h-6 w-full justify-start font-normal normal-case">
                                    <span class="text-base-content/50">▸</span><span class="truncate"><%= GiftPlans.condition_label(refresh_case["condition"], @plan_data) || "always" %></span>
                                  </button>
                                <% end %>
                              <% else %>
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 h-6">
                                  <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">always</span>
                                  <button type="button" phx-click="cond_add" phx-value-case_id={refresh_case["id"]} phx-value-path="" phx-value-node="leaf"
                                          class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs">+ Condition</button>
                                </div>
                              <% end %>
                              <p :for={warning <- GiftPlans.condition_warnings(refresh_case["condition"], @plan_data, section)} class="mt-1 flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] text-warning">
                                <.icon name="lucide-triangle-exclamation-point" class="size-3.5 shrink-0" /><%= warning %>
                              </p>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/70 leading-6">then</span>
                            <form phx-change="list_update_refresh_case" class="flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0">
                              <input type="hidden" name="case_id" value={refresh_case["id"]} />
                              <div class="join">
                                <label :for={{action, label} <- [{"leave", "Leave"}, {"refresh", "Refresh"}, {"affinity_refresh", "Keyword"}]}
                                       class="join-item btn btn-xs gap-1 has-[:checked]:btn-primary">
                                  <input type="radio" name="action" value={action} checked={refresh_case["action"] == action} class="hidden" />
                                  <%= label %><.icon :if={action == "affinity_refresh"} name="lucide-refresh-cw" class="size-3" />
                                </label>
                                <details id={"refresh-aff-#{refresh_case["id"]}"} phx-hook="FloatingDropdown" data-close-on-click class="dropdown join-item border-0">
                                  <summary class={"btn btn-xs rounded-[inherit] gap-1 flex-nowrap whitespace-nowrap " <> if(refresh_case["action"] == "affinity_refresh", do: "btn-primary", else: "opacity-40 grayscale")}>
                                    <img :if={(refresh_case["affinity"] || @plan_data["affinity"]) not in [nil, ""]} src={gift_affinity_icon(refresh_case["affinity"] || @plan_data["affinity"])} class="sinner-icon w-3 h-3 object-contain shrink-0" />
                                    <%= refresh_case["affinity"] || "plan" %>
                                  </summary>
                                  <div popover="manual" class="dropdown-content z-30 w-max rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-1 shadow">
                                    <ul class="menu menu-xs w-36 p-0 whitespace-nowrap">
                                      <li>
                                        <label class="cursor-pointer">
                                          <input type="radio" name="affinity" value="" checked={refresh_case["affinity"] == nil} class="hidden" />
                                          <img :if={@plan_data["affinity"] not in [nil, ""]} src={gift_affinity_icon(@plan_data["affinity"])} class="w-3 h-3 object-contain" />plan
                                        </label>
                                      </li>
                                      <li class="pointer-events-none my-1 h-px bg-base-300 p-0"></li>
                                      <%= for affinity <- affinity_order() do %>
                                        <li :if={affinity == "slash"} class="pointer-events-none my-1 h-px bg-base-300 p-0"></li>
                                        <li>
                                          <label class="cursor-pointer">
                                            <input type="radio" name="affinity" value={affinity} checked={refresh_case["affinity"] == affinity} class="hidden" />
                                            <img src={gift_affinity_icon(affinity)} class="w-3 h-3 object-contain" /><%= affinity %>
                                          </label>
                                        </li>
                                      <% end %>
                                    </ul>
                                  </div>
                                </details>
                              </div>
                              <span :if={refresh_case["action"] != "leave"} class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/70">up to</span>
                              <input :if={refresh_case["action"] != "leave"} type="number" name="max" min="0" value={refresh_case["max"]} placeholder="∞"
                                     phx-debounce="300" class="input input-bordered input-xs w-14" />
                              <span :if={refresh_case["action"] != "leave"} class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/70 whitespace-nowrap">cost after &gt;=</span>
                              <input :if={refresh_case["action"] != "leave"} type="number" name="min_cost" min="0" value={Map.get(refresh_case, "min_cost", GiftPlans.default_min_cost())}
                                     phx-debounce="300" class="input input-bordered input-xs w-16" />
                            </form>
                            <button type="button" phx-click="list_remove_refresh_case" phx-value-case_id={refresh_case["id"]} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs px-1 text-error"><.icon name="lucide-x" class="size-3.5" /></button>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rounded border border-dashed border-base-300 px-1 py-1 flex items-center gap-2">
                          <span class="px-1 invisible">⠿</span>
                          <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/70 w-12 shrink-0"><%= if GiftPlans.refresh_cases(section, refresh_from) == [], do: "always", else: "else" %></span>
                          <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">leave the shop</span>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <% end %>

                    <% fusion_section = @fusion_entry_id && Enum.find(GiftPlans.sections(@plan_data, section["id"]), &GiftPlans.find_entry(&1, @fusion_entry_id)) %>
                    <% fusion_entry = fusion_section && GiftPlans.find_entry(fusion_section, @fusion_entry_id) %>
                    <% target = fusion_entry && @gifts_by_name[GiftPlans.subject_gift(fusion_entry)] %>
                    <div :if={fusion_entry && target && fusion_entry["fusion"]} class="modal modal-open">
                      <div class="modal-box w-11/12 max-w-4xl h-[85vh] flex flex-col gap-2">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                          <img src={target.image_path} class="w-10 h-10 rounded object-cover" />
                          <div class="flex flex-col">
                            <span class="text-sm font-semibold"><%= target.name %></span>
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">Tier <%= target.tier %> · <%= target.affinity %> · <%= fusion_entry["fusion"]["type"] %> fusion</span>
                          </div>
                          <button phx-click="list_close_fusion" class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost ml-auto">Close</button>
                        </div>
                        <%= if GiftPlans.fixed_fusion?(fusion_entry) do %>
                          <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">
                            Fixed recipe. Each ingredient is its own entry in this stage: a missing one is bought if its entry has Buy on,
                            otherwise fused if its entry has Fuse on. Red ingredients aren't in this stage, so they're never bought or fused for this.
                          </span>
                          <.recipe_tree gift={target} section={fusion_section} gifts_by_id={@gifts_by_id} gifts_by_name={@gifts_by_name} />
                        <% else %>
                          <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">
                            Routes, tried in order. Each picks a combo from the valid pool and can buy missing ingredients up to a tier,
                            demand leftover unkept items before fusing, and fuse sub-goals for its ingredient tiers.
                            Normal shops skip combos marked super only. These routes are shared by every floor of this entry.
                          </span>
                          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <button type="button" phx-click="rt_copy" phx-value-def_id={fusion_entry["id"]} class="btn btn-xs">Copy routes</button>
                            <button type="button" phx-click="rt_paste" phx-value-def_id={fusion_entry["id"]} class="btn btn-xs"
                                    disabled={is_nil(@route_clipboard) or @route_clipboard.tier != target.tier}
                                    data-confirm="Replace all routes with the copied ones?">Paste routes</button>
                            <span :if={@route_clipboard} class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">
                              Clipboard: <%= @route_clipboard.name %> (T<%= @route_clipboard.tier %>, <%= length(@route_clipboard.routes) %> route(s))
                            </span>
                          </div>
                          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">T<%= target.tier %> templates</span>
                            <span :if={@route_templates[target.tier] == []} class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">No T<%= target.tier %> templates yet</span>
                            <div :for={template <- @route_templates[target.tier] || []} class="flex items-center gap-2">
                              <button type="button" phx-click="rt_apply_template" phx-value-def_id={fusion_entry["id"]} phx-value-ref={template.ref} class="btn btn-xs"
                                      data-confirm={"Replace all routes with the template #{template.name}?"}>Apply</button>
                              <span class="text-xs font-semibold"><%= template.name %></span>
                              <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60"><%= Enum.map_join(template.routes, ", ", &Routes.label/1) %></span>
                              <button :if={template.deletable} type="button" phx-click="rt_delete_template" phx-value-ref={template.ref} class="btn btn-xs btn-ghost"
                                      data-confirm={"Delete the template #{template.name}?"}>Delete</button>
                            </div>
                            <form phx-submit="rt_save_template" class="flex items-center gap-2">
                              <input type="hidden" name="def_id" value={fusion_entry["id"]} />
                              <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Template name" autocomplete="off" class="input input-xs input-bordered" />
                              <button type="submit" class="btn btn-xs">Save routes as T<%= target.tier %> template</button>
                            </form>
                          </div>
                          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">Routes for</span>
                            <div class="join">
                              <button :for={shop <- [:normal, :super]} type="button" phx-click="set_route_shop" phx-value-shop={shop}
                                      class={"btn btn-xs join-item " <> if(@route_shop == shop, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-outline")}>
                                <%= if shop == :normal, do: "Normal shop", else: "Super shop" %>
                              </button>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <.route_list def_id={fusion_entry["id"]} routes={fusion_entry["fusion"]["routes"] || []} tier={target.tier} shop={@route_shop} />
                        <% end %>
                      </div>
                      <div class="modal-backdrop" phx-click="list_close_fusion"></div>
                    </div>
                  <% else %>
                    <div class="text-xs text-base-content/40 italic">This plan has no shopping list to edit.</div>
                  <% end %>
                  <% end %>
                </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            

          </div>

        <% else %>
          <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col gap-2 items-center justify-center text-base-content/40 text-sm">
            This team has no gift plan.
            <button type="button" phx-click="new_plan" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">+ New gift plan</button>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  <%= if @show_help do %>
    <div class="modal modal-open" phx-window-keydown="toggle_help" phx-key="Escape">
      <div class="modal-box max-w-3xl max-h-[85vh] flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm">
        <h2 class="font-bold text-base">How gift plans work</h2>
        <div class="overflow-y-auto flex flex-col gap-3 pr-1">
          <section>
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-1">Two parts</h4>
            <p><span class="font-medium">Loadout</span> is everything set up before the first shop: the starting gift, gift search, graces and mounting trials. It applies to every run. <span class="font-medium">Shopping list</span> drives what the bot buys, keeps, fuses and refreshes in each shop. Switch between them with the buttons at the top.</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-1">Shopping list</h4>
            <p>The bot works on the shopping list until its goals are met. Drag gifts from the search on the left into it, or use Add.</p>
            <ul class="mt-1 list-disc pl-5 flex flex-col gap-1">
              <li><span class="font-medium">Run timelines</span>: on a gift with a schedule, the swords button after the last tab adds a separate set of tabs that only applies to the run types you tick (normal F1-F5, hard starting F2-F5, hard from F1, extreme planned). Runs of any other type use the first set of tabs. To keep a gift out of some runs, abandon it in the first tab set and give the runs that want it their own timeline.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Required</span> entries must all be owned. Extra goals ("at least N of") let a group of entries count as one requirement.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">+ Add stage</span> adds another Required and goals stage below the entries. The bot finishes everything above it first, then works on the stage, with the same refresh cases. Earlier gifts stay kept. The Add button on the search adds to the last stage; drag a gift onto any stage to add it there. A gift can be in several stages, and the later stage's definition applies once the earlier one is done. Optional gifts from earlier stages stay in the pool while working later stages, since the pool only grows. Any tier and any affinity entries and required entries do not carry over; if one goes missing, the bot goes back to its stage.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Any-tier and any-affinity</span> entries never count toward goals and never keep anything. Buy buys matches when no wanted gift is on the shelf, and Sell sells matches at the start of the shop. A specific gift entry overrides them.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Fixed fusions</span> add their ingredients too. Open a fusion entry to choose its routes. See <span class="font-mono text-xs">docs/fusion.md</span> for the fusion rules.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Greatly heal</span> and <span class="font-medium">Revive</span> pick sinners to restore while working on the shop.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">+ Keep shopping</span> adds a section at the end. With it, the bot keeps buying and refreshing after the last stage is done, until a refresh case leaves the shop. It buys optional gifts from every stage plus whatever the last stage's Ignore + Buy entries match, up to their caps. Remove it with the X to turn that off.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-1">Refresh</h4>
            <p>Cases are checked top to bottom, like if / else if. The first case whose condition is true runs its action: Refresh, Keyword Refresh or Leave Shop, optionally up to a maximum count, and only while the cost left after the refresh stays at or above the minimum (250 by default, 0 to ignore). If no case matches, the bot stops working on the shop.</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-1">Loadout</h4>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 flex flex-col gap-1">
              <li><span class="font-medium">Affinity and cabinet order</span>: the starting gift picks, in order. The cabinet only allows as many picks as your graces give.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Gift search</span>: gifts to pick on the gift search screen after the cabinet, Tier 3 and under. Each slot costs <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-base-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium align-middle"><img src="/images/icons/starlight.webp" alt="Starlight" class="h-3 w-3" />starlight</span>. Leave it empty to skip gift search.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Graces</span>: starter buffs, each with two enhancement tiers. Pick the ones to select on every run; the total Starlight cost is shown.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Mounting trials</span>: from a floor onward, either avoid boosting enemy HP or take the best gift. With no rows every floor takes the best gift.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Encounter rewards</span>: from a floor onward, the order of reward types. The first one visible on screen is taken; if none is, the highest tier available.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-1">Issues</h4>
            <p>The badge in the corner lists problems found in the plan. Hover it for the details.</p>
          </section>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-action mt-0">
          <button phx-click="toggle_help" class="btn btn-sm">Close</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-backdrop" phx-click="toggle_help"></div>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</div>
